{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Shimmer",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Venice's lagoon at golden hour, alive: its bed (the open sea, the lagoon, its tidal flats and the channels between them) blurred into a depth that ramps from pale turquoise flats to deep teal channels and a navy sea; caustics where drifting noise crosses its middle, brightest in the shallows; sun glitter where fine moving noise peaks, dense and hot under the sun and thinning to a few points away from it, a few flaring and blooming as a slower noise passes, all along a sun path down the view that blows out at the horizon; foam inside the shores broken by drifting noise; slow swells passing over the water's colour; on warm stone, terracotta roofs in three tones lifting off their warm shadows, sage gardens and pale squares; a warm haze toward the horizon in leaning views."
  },
